# Soft scroll-edge effect

Every `ScrollView`, `List`, and `Form` in Gymship must use `.scrollEdgeEffectStyle(.soft, for: .all)` (via `.gymshipScrollEdges()`).

- Do not ship a new scroll container without it.
- Do not use `.hard`.
- Do not pass a `for:` edge set that leaves another edge unstyled — always `for: .all`.
- Apply it on the scroll container itself, including horizontal `ScrollView`s.

```swift
ScrollView {
    // content
}
.scrollEdgeEffectStyle(.soft, for: .all)
```
